00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:15.040
I've got industrial strength Velcro that I'm using to secure

00:00:15.040 --> 00:00:18.020
the pieces of crafty foam to the glove.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:18.640
*riiip*

