00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:03.240
And we're ready to shoot the video.

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:07.440
I got an interesting idea a few years back.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:11.640
A neighbor that used to live in our building did etchings in acrylic.

00:01:11.640 --> 00:01:13.660
he would light them with LED lights.

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:16.740
Put LED lights on the edge of acrylic, the etchings kinda glow.

00:01:16.740 --> 00:01:18.460
So, you know,

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:22.220
If he had a red panel, a green panel, and a blue panel, and he layered them,

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:24.960
that effectively give you RGB pixels.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.520
You can make any color you want.

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.340
He's named Corri after the company.

00:01:35.340 --> 00:01:38.480
So, eventually I went onto Amazon, I bought three pieces of acrylic.

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:40.660
And three sets of RGB LEDs.

00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:42.700
Put the red LEDs on one set

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:43.800
the green on another

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:44.520
and the blue on another.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:47.840
And then I use a Dremel to go to town etching the whole thing.

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.060
So here we have all the colors of the rainbow by me etching on red, blue and green.

00:01:54.060 --> 00:01:55.600
Let me show you what happens when I split this apart.

00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:58.260
So you see I have the blues kinda etched here

00:01:58.260 --> 00:01:59.480
reds kinda etched here

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:01.060
and the greens kinda there.

00:02:01.060 --> 00:02:02.500
So when I put them together...

00:02:04.460 --> 00:02:06.300
So you kinda have to back up to get the full effect here.

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:07.960
So I just did a little landscape etching.

00:02:07.960 --> 00:02:09.680
And the next step is to go bigger.

00:02:09.680 --> 00:02:12.300
I want to get a nice big piece of acrylic like this.

00:02:12.300 --> 00:02:16.940
So if you guys have any ideas of something that would work with this crazy color scheme, let me know.

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:18.640
Crazy sunset with a laser bridge.

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:20.180
Pink tiger with green eyes.

00:02:20.180 --> 00:02:21.620
Uhhhh an explosion....

00:02:21.620 --> 00:02:22.880
with laser beams.

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:25.320
If it has lasers in it, pretty much guaranteed to work.

